{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15205480","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15205480","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1520548001:1":{"text":"魔力の使い過ぎです、モルガン。","source_cn":"摩根，你魔力使用过度了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x201461A736BCAADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520548002:0":{"text":"儀式をもっと早く終わらせることもできたはずでは？たとえ片時でも、死者の魂に会えたことは、残された者たちにとって十分な慰めになったでしょう。","source_cn":"祭祀仪式其实早就可以结束，不是吗？那些悲痛的生者已经见...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51A05940B87032FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520548003:0":{"text":"ごほっ……あいつらの、話が長すぎるんだよ……","source_cn":"咳……谁让他们话那么多，说个没完。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DAA9DB920FF2692","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520548004:0":{"text":"彼らの魂は、森に還ったのですか？","source_cn":"那些灵魂，他们回归丛林了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F4DF29C963B1915","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520548005:0":{"text":"ええ。モルガンは魔法で一時的に彼らを現世に呼び戻しただけです。これから魂は生命の木へ還り、やがて私たちにはまだ知り得ぬ姿や存在となって、この世界へ戻ってくるでしょう……","source_cn":"是的。摩根的魔法只会暂时将他们唤回现世，之后，他们仍会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB573A1EAB382276F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docum